1
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:32,333
Reiner!

2
00:01:03,042 --> 00:01:04,458
Eren!

3
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:11,375
I think the fight's over. We're out of strength.

4
00:01:11,375 --> 00:01:16,250
At this point, I can't exactly kill Reiner.

5
00:01:18,958 --> 00:01:22,750
In that case, let's go back home.

6
00:01:25,042 --> 00:01:27,792
See you later, Reiner.

7
00:01:45,542 --> 00:01:50,917
Protect the airship from below!
Use every last shot you've got!

8
00:01:50,917 --> 00:01:56,583
They're retreating... Does this mean we're safe?

9
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,042
They're running.

10
00:02:03,583 --> 00:02:04,833
Gabi!

11
00:02:04,833 --> 00:02:09,167
Eren Jaeger!

12
00:02:09,167 --> 00:02:10,583
Gabi!

13
00:02:10,583 --> 00:02:14,292
You won't get away! I'm gonna kill you!

14
00:03:43,958 --> 00:03:48,958
"Assassin's Bullet"

15
00:04:31,417 --> 00:04:34,167
Damn, you're a filthy sight.

16
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:39,125
You fall in a pile of shit?

17
00:04:39,125 --> 00:04:41,458
Eren...

18
00:04:41,458 --> 00:04:43,500
Captain...

19
00:04:58,292 --> 00:05:05,250
This brings back memories, Eren.
You have such a kickable face.

20
00:05:05,250 --> 00:05:09,750
After you're all tied up, we'll have a chat.

21
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:15,125
That's fine, but I explained
everything in the letters.

22
00:05:15,125 --> 00:05:17,833
Did you not understand it?

23
00:05:20,167 --> 00:05:26,542
That face... It reminds me of the
rotten shits who lived underground.

24
00:05:26,542 --> 00:05:30,250
Never thought I'd see it on you.

25
00:05:31,917 --> 00:05:36,667
Cheer up. Everything happened like you wanted.

26
00:05:44,875 --> 00:05:48,708
Stop 'em! Kill every last one you can!

27
00:05:51,625 --> 00:05:57,292
Everybody, in! They've got nothing
to take down an airship!

28
00:05:57,292 --> 00:05:59,250
Jean!

29
00:05:59,250 --> 00:06:02,417
You go! I'll hold the rear!

30
00:06:02,417 --> 00:06:05,083
It's all you, Commander Lobov!

31
00:06:05,083 --> 00:06:08,833
I told you, I'm a recruit!

32
00:06:08,833 --> 00:06:12,167
Nobody needs the Garrison anymore!

33
00:06:13,667 --> 00:06:16,750
Especially not some overpaid geezer!

34
00:06:18,875 --> 00:06:19,708
Jean!

35
00:06:19,708 --> 00:06:21,333
Grab on!

36
00:06:24,625 --> 00:06:25,792
Who's left?

37
00:06:25,792 --> 00:06:28,292
Still waiting on Lima Squad.

38
00:06:28,292 --> 00:06:32,000
As far as we know, there're six casualties.

39
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,458
I see... Shit!

40
00:06:34,458 --> 00:06:38,375
That's nothing compared to the damage we did!

41
00:06:38,375 --> 00:06:40,250
It's a huge victory!

42
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:45,000
The New Eldian Empire's
first battle ends in victory!

43
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,833
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

44
00:06:48,833 --> 00:06:54,708
Tonight, we celebrate in honor
of our six fallen heroes!

45
00:06:57,167 --> 00:07:02,542
First battle, huh?
How many more till the fighting ends?

46
00:07:02,542 --> 00:07:05,667
Just how many have to die?

47
00:07:09,583 --> 00:07:13,500
Anyways, I'm just glad we survived again.

48
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:19,208
It's not very fair to the others,
but you guys are special...

49
00:07:19,208 --> 00:07:20,917
...to me.

50
00:07:26,458 --> 00:07:30,917
That hurts, idiot. Don't hug us
wearing hard-ass gear.

51
00:07:30,917 --> 00:07:36,750
Excuse me, Jean?! You're the idiot for
always fussing over your tiny-ass beard!

52
00:07:36,750 --> 00:07:37,583
Huh?

53
00:07:37,583 --> 00:07:41,708
That's right! Why grow a beard
if you can't eat it?

54
00:07:41,708 --> 00:07:42,625
Huh?!

55
00:07:42,625 --> 00:07:45,125
Say, are we eating soon?

56
00:07:45,125 --> 00:07:47,292
Not till we reach the island.

57
00:07:47,292 --> 00:07:50,833
What a useless leader you are.

58
00:07:50,833 --> 00:07:52,333
Gabi!

59
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,458
Gabi, wait!

60
00:08:10,375 --> 00:08:12,917
C'mon, that's enough.

61
00:08:12,917 --> 00:08:17,125
They're flying away.
Running after them is pointless.

62
00:08:17,125 --> 00:08:19,375
Even you know that.

63
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:27,042
Zofia...

64
00:08:27,042 --> 00:08:33,333
Zofia's body was crushed under debris.
I was sitting right next to her.

65
00:08:33,333 --> 00:08:38,917
Udo tried to help her,
but he got trampled by the stampede.

66
00:08:38,917 --> 00:08:44,042
Stepped on, over and over,
until his head split open.

67
00:08:44,042 --> 00:08:49,333
And the two gate guards... They stopped me.

68
00:08:49,333 --> 00:08:52,583
I was trying to run back to the plaza.

69
00:08:52,583 --> 00:08:58,458
I'm an Eldian, but they told me to
turn back because it's dangerous.

70
00:08:58,458 --> 00:09:03,250
Then they were shot by a girl
on the roof and died.

71
00:09:05,708 --> 00:09:12,250
Being an Eldian born in the zone,
people spit at me when I go outside.

72
00:09:12,250 --> 00:09:18,542
I've had a lot of miserable memories,
but that's why I try so hard.

73
00:09:18,542 --> 00:09:23,208
To show the world that Eldians
are good people!

74
00:09:23,208 --> 00:09:28,250
So that someday, we could be proud
of our Eldian armbands!

75
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:34,333
I worked hard believing it could happen!
But they crushed everything!

76
00:09:34,333 --> 00:09:41,000
This internment zone is my home!
It's where the people I care about live!

77
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:44,708
Isn't trampling on it unforgivable?!

78
00:09:47,292 --> 00:09:52,333
And yet, you're telling me
not to run after them?

79
00:09:52,333 --> 00:09:57,208
When Zeke was killed before our eyes
and we could do nothing?

80
00:09:57,208 --> 00:10:00,917
Not knowing why any of this happened?!

81
00:10:00,917 --> 00:10:07,833
Why, Reiner? Why was my mom eaten by a Titan?

82
00:10:10,167 --> 00:10:12,292
They were trampled on.

83
00:10:12,292 --> 00:10:13,708
Huh?

84
00:10:13,708 --> 00:10:19,208
The enemy was attacked by Marley
Warriors and lots of people died.

85
00:10:19,208 --> 00:10:21,417
This is revenge.

86
00:10:23,458 --> 00:10:27,917
Did you... see it happen?

87
00:10:27,917 --> 00:10:31,625
No, I didn't.

88
00:10:31,625 --> 00:10:34,958
Neither did I.

89
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:51,250
Besides, they're all just island devils
who threaten world peace.

90
00:10:51,250 --> 00:10:57,625
You should know that! They're cruel
devils who've always deserved to die.

91
00:10:57,625 --> 00:11:00,000
They're nothing like us.

92
00:11:02,500 --> 00:11:06,125
Reiner, I'm the same as you.

93
00:11:06,125 --> 00:11:11,958
Across the sea, within the walls...
It's the same.

94
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:22,417
Lima Squad? That means everyone's aboard.

95
00:11:22,417 --> 00:11:25,417
Tell the bridge we're good to ascend!

96
00:11:25,417 --> 00:11:27,083
Roger!

97
00:11:31,458 --> 00:11:32,792
Huh?

98
00:11:35,667 --> 00:11:37,208
A kid?!

99
00:11:45,875 --> 00:11:48,000
It hit!

100
00:11:56,875 --> 00:12:00,583
It's still attached...

101
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:04,125
Gabi!

102
00:12:05,917 --> 00:12:08,250
What do you think you're doing?!

103
00:12:08,250 --> 00:12:12,000
This trigger... If I pull it...

104
00:12:15,042 --> 00:12:20,292
Gabi... Don't tell me you're
thinking of boarding it!

105
00:12:20,292 --> 00:12:22,917
I'm gonna kill those island devils!

106
00:12:22,917 --> 00:12:26,208
You'll just end up dead, idiot!

107
00:12:26,208 --> 00:12:31,625
Tell my mom and dad.
Let Reiner and the others know:

108
00:12:31,625 --> 00:12:35,333
That I fought till the end.

109
00:12:35,333 --> 00:12:41,125
Even if we don't win today,
you guys will carry on my will.

110
00:12:41,125 --> 00:12:44,167
Falco! Gabi!

111
00:12:44,167 --> 00:12:47,333
What the hell are you guys doing?!

112
00:12:47,333 --> 00:12:49,000
My brother...

113
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,125
Goodbye, Falco.

114
00:12:51,125 --> 00:12:55,250
You were one of the good ones.

115
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:03,792
You have to rescue Gabi
from the dark future that awaits us.

116
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:09,750
Falco!

117
00:13:13,667 --> 00:13:15,458
Falco?!

118
00:13:16,458 --> 00:13:17,458
Why?!

119
00:13:17,458 --> 00:13:21,708
The one who should inherit
the Armored Titan... is me!

120
00:13:21,708 --> 00:13:23,500
Huh?!

121
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:32,167
Did you hear a sound just now?

122
00:13:32,167 --> 00:13:34,000
Hey! Quiet down!

123
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:37,000
Make some noise! Victory!

124
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,500
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

125
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:39,792
Hey!

126
00:13:39,792 --> 00:13:42,042
Isn't Lobov still out there?

127
00:13:42,042 --> 00:13:45,667
No, I think he came aboard.

128
00:14:04,333 --> 00:14:06,167
Sasha!

129
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:12,000
"The military's official bolt-action rifle fires
five shots and can be equipped with the
standard-issue knife as a bayonet. They are used
by Marley's Warrior unit, army, and navy."

130
00:14:27,292 --> 00:14:29,542
You bastard!

131
00:14:31,167 --> 00:14:33,625
Sasha! Hey!

132
00:14:33,625 --> 00:14:36,958
Hang in there! Hey!

133
00:14:38,292 --> 00:14:42,833
You're so... damn loud...

134
00:14:44,833 --> 00:14:49,333
Are we... eating soon?

135
00:14:49,333 --> 00:14:52,333
Bandages, now!
We've gotta stop the bleeding!

136
00:14:52,333 --> 00:14:53,208
Right!

137
00:14:53,208 --> 00:14:56,000
Sasha! Make it to the island!

138
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,375
Meat...

139
00:15:13,667 --> 00:15:19,042
Jean, they climbed aboard
using Lobov's ODM gear.

140
00:15:20,542 --> 00:15:24,375
I'll toss 'em outside. All right?

141
00:15:29,167 --> 00:15:36,333
If we toss kids out of an airship,
will the killing ever end?

142
00:15:47,375 --> 00:15:49,958
What happened to Braun and Grice?

143
00:15:49,958 --> 00:15:55,292
They ran off without warning
and never came back.

144
00:16:00,292 --> 00:16:02,167
Pieck...

145
00:16:04,083 --> 00:16:09,500
Commander, I remember...

146
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:16,333
There was a Marley soldier who
led Galliard and me into a trap.

147
00:16:19,167 --> 00:16:23,708
I remember seeing that
same soldier three years ago.

148
00:16:23,708 --> 00:16:32,833
They were on the first scout fleet sent
to Paradis after Reiner came back.

149
00:16:32,833 --> 00:16:35,458
The missing scout ships?

150
00:16:35,458 --> 00:16:39,667
Yes. I'm sure of it.

151
00:16:39,667 --> 00:16:43,750
They looked so awful with a beard.

152
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:47,292
Hey, you gonna wear that forever?

153
00:16:47,292 --> 00:16:52,042
Huh? I thought it was well-received.

154
00:16:55,542 --> 00:16:58,125
They're still celebrating?

155
00:16:58,125 --> 00:17:02,958
Don't touch me, you devils!
We haven't lost yet!

156
00:17:02,958 --> 00:17:08,208
The rest of our comrades will carry
on the will of War Chief Zeke!

157
00:17:08,208 --> 00:17:11,000
Gabi, stop!

158
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,667
What do we do with 'em, Jean?

159
00:17:15,250 --> 00:17:19,000
Us true Eldians are gonna
haunt you till you die!

160
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:23,500
Pass that on to your
ringleader after I'm dead!

161
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:26,458
I'll take you to him.

162
00:17:26,458 --> 00:17:30,542
You can tell him exactly what you told me.

163
00:17:40,125 --> 00:17:43,500
How'd you identify the soldier?

164
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:50,458
Well, it's someone I had
a particular interest in.

165
00:17:50,458 --> 00:17:56,417
Because... she's a devout follower of Zeke.

166
00:17:56,417 --> 00:18:01,042
Gabi... Falco...? Why are you here?

167
00:18:01,042 --> 00:18:04,167
Why? Why are you?

168
00:18:04,167 --> 00:18:08,792
You're alive?! Why did you
let them capture you?!

169
00:18:12,250 --> 00:18:14,083
Who are these kids?

170
00:18:14,083 --> 00:18:18,833
They killed Lobov and used
his gear to come aboard.

171
00:18:18,833 --> 00:18:22,250
Sasha was shot by this one here.

172
00:18:23,625 --> 00:18:27,000
I don't think she's gonna make it.

173
00:18:33,167 --> 00:18:35,750
It's all you, Onyankopon.

174
00:18:35,750 --> 00:18:37,708
You got it, Hange!

175
00:18:39,708 --> 00:18:45,792
Well? Did everything play out
as you hoped, Zeke Jaeger?

176
00:18:47,542 --> 00:18:49,667
Huh?

177
00:18:49,667 --> 00:18:55,500
For the most part,
but there were a few miscalculations.

178
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:57,875
Zeke...?

179
00:18:57,875 --> 00:19:01,750
Huh? Who are these kids?

180
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:03,167
Miscalculations.

181
00:19:03,167 --> 00:19:08,167
Yelena! What the hell happened
to trapping the Cart and Jaw?!

182
00:19:08,167 --> 00:19:10,833
People died because of you!

183
00:19:10,833 --> 00:19:18,250
I'm sorry. I assure you they fell
down the hole, but it's still my fault.

184
00:19:18,250 --> 00:19:24,667
And to cover for that slip-up, the Beast
chucked more rocks at us than planned.

185
00:19:24,667 --> 00:19:30,917
That was some clever improv for a clown
like you. Wouldn't you say, hairball?

186
00:19:30,917 --> 00:19:37,125
Don't glare at me like that, Levi.
What if I piss my pants?

187
00:19:37,125 --> 00:19:44,250
And you're quite the actor yourself,
considering you want to kill me so bad.

188
00:19:45,458 --> 00:19:50,458
I'm the kind of person
who saves the best bite for last.

189
00:19:50,458 --> 00:19:53,792
I like to savor the taste.

190
00:19:54,667 --> 00:20:00,417
We killed the Marley brass
and destroyed their port and fleet.

191
00:20:00,417 --> 00:20:03,250
That should buy us some time.

192
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:08,333
Until the whole world launches
a joint attack on Paradis?

193
00:20:08,333 --> 00:20:14,000
Every time you're caught by the enemy,
we sacrifice lives to get you back.

194
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,917
No matter how many it takes.

195
00:20:16,917 --> 00:20:22,958
And yet knowing that, you went
so far as to make yourself a hostage.

196
00:20:22,958 --> 00:20:27,250
Just like you hoped,
we didn't have much choice.

197
00:20:27,250 --> 00:20:33,542
You put your trust in us
and we lost our trust in you.

198
00:20:33,542 --> 00:20:39,458
But now we have the Founding Titan
and a Titan with royal blood.

199
00:20:39,458 --> 00:20:46,333
The cost of those sacrifices
will be paid through Eldia's freedom.

200
00:20:57,542 --> 00:20:59,750
Sasha...

201
00:20:59,750 --> 00:21:01,875
...is dead.

202
00:21:21,708 --> 00:21:23,833
Conny.

203
00:21:23,833 --> 00:21:29,875
Did Sasha... have any last words?

204
00:21:29,875 --> 00:21:33,875
She said... "Meat."

205
00:21:44,500 --> 00:21:49,833
I brought some meat from
the officers' storehouse!

206
00:21:52,125 --> 00:21:54,042
It'll be fine!

207
00:21:54,042 --> 00:21:59,042
We can just raise more cattle and sheep
once we retake our land!

208
00:22:11,833 --> 00:22:19,083
Eren... Sasha only died because you
dragged the Scouts into this.

209
00:24:02,875 --> 00:24:06,917
Could they have taken some other path?

210
00:24:06,917 --> 00:24:14,708
Unable to change the past, they must
continue down the one before them.

211
00:24:14,708 --> 00:24:17,088
Next episode: "Brave Volunteers."
